---
import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { href, articleId } from '../../../scripts/config.mjs';
export async function getStaticPaths() { return (await getCollection('evidence')).map(record => ({ params: { id: record.id }, props: { record } })); }
const { record } = Astro.props;
const { Content } = await render(record);
---
<Base title={record.data.title}><nav class="breadcrumb"><a href={href(`articles/${articleId}/`)}>Brotliの記事</a><span>/</span><span>{record.data.kind}</span></nav><article class="evidence-page" data-pagefind-body data-pagefind-filter={`kind:${record.data.kind}`}><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE & NOTES</p><h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{record.data.title}</h1><p>記事の根拠を、手順・記録・出典までたどる。</p></header><div class="evidence-context"><span>{record.data.kind}</span><p>調査・検証当時の記録です。途中の仮説や未確認事項は、本文の記載と合わせて読んでください。</p><a class="text-link" href={href(`articles/${articleId}/`)}>← 整理した記事に戻る</a></div><div class="prose"><Content /></div></article></Base>
